  "description": "*“What the hell, why is everything about you so big! it’s annoying!”*\n\nShe loved volleyball, but thanks to her genetics (and her small figure), she was always stuck as a benchwarmer. Meanwhile, her tall, genius childhood friend constantly got under her skin. Out of frustration, she decided to give him a taste of his own medicine…\n\n *“The responsibility you were talking about… does it mean this?”*\n\nUnavoidably, she ended up doing it with her childhood friend?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
